#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_sale/models/l10n_ve_discount_document.py:0
msgid ""
"%(document)s is waiting for the approval of its discount: %(applied)s%% "
"against a maximum of %(limit)s%%."
msgstr ""
"%(document)s está esperando la aprobación de su descuento: %(applied)s%% "
"frente a un máximo de %(limit)s%%."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_sale.view_order_form_l10n_ve_discount
msgid ""
"<strong>The discount exceeds the maximum allowed.</strong> When you confirm the\n"
"                    order it will go to a discount approval stage."
msgstr ""
"<strong>El descuento excede el máximo permitido.</strong> Al confirmar el "
"pedido pasará a una etapa de aprobación del descuento."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_sale.view_move_form_l10n_ve_discount
msgid ""
"<strong>The discount exceeds the maximum allowed.</strong> When you post the\n"
"                    invoice it will go to a discount approval stage."
msgstr ""
"<strong>El descuento excede el máximo permitido.</strong> Al publicar la "
"factura pasará a una etapa de aprobación del descuento."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_sale.view_order_form_l10n_ve_discount
msgid ""
"<strong>To Approve:</strong> the discount exceeds the maximum allowed. A discount\n"
"                    approver must approve it: approving confirms the order. Lowering the discount\n"
"                    under the limit also takes it out of this stage."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Por aprobar:</strong> el descuento excede el máximo permitido. Un "
"aprobador de descuentos debe aprobarlo: al aprobarlo se confirma el pedido. "
"Bajar el descuento por debajo del límite también lo saca de esta etapa."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_sale.view_move_form_l10n_ve_discount
msgid ""
"<strong>To Approve:</strong> the discount exceeds the maximum allowed. A discount\n"
"                    approver must approve it: approving posts the invoice."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Por aprobar:</strong> el descuento excede el máximo permitido. Un "
"aprobador de descuentos debe aprobarlo: al aprobarlo se publica la factura."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_sale.field_res_company__discount_approval_enabled
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_sale.field_res_config_settings__discount_approval_enabled
msgid ""
"A discount above the maximum can be applied, but the document moves to 'To "
"Approve' until a discount approver validates it."
msgstr ""
"Se puede aplicar un descuento superior al máximo, pero el documento pasa a "
"'Por aprobar' hasta que un aprobador de descuentos lo valide."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_sale.res_config_settings_l10n_ve_sale_discount_limits
msgid ""
"A discount above the maximum moves the document to 'To Approve' until a "
"discount approver validates it."
msgstr ""
"Un descuento superior al máximo pasa el documento a 'Por aprobar' hasta que "
"un aprobador de descuentos lo valide."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_sale/models/l10n_ve_discount_document.py:0
msgid ""
"A global discount is applied to this document. Remove it before discounting "
"individual lines."
msgstr ""
"Este documento tiene un descuento global. Quítelo antes de aplicar "
"descuentos por línea."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_sale.field_res_company__global_discount_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_sale.field_res_config_settings__global_discount_account_id
msgid ""
"Account where the global discounts of customer invoices are recorded. It can"
" differ from the line discount account."
msgstr ""
"Cuenta donde se registran los descuentos globales de las facturas de "
"cliente. Puede ser distinta a la de los descuentos por línea."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_sale.res_config_settings_l10n_ve_sale_global_discount
msgid ""
"Account where the global discounts of customer invoices are recorded. "
"Required to apply a global discount."
msgstr ""
"Cuenta donde se registran los descuentos globales de las facturas de "
"cliente. Obligatoria para aplicar un descuento global."

#. module: l10n_ve_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_sale/models/l10n_ve_discount_document.py:0
